---
title: "ST-03 Runner Lifecycle (UML State Machine Diagram)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> online: registered with registration token
  state online {
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> busy: claims job
    busy --> idle: job finished (capacity free)
    busy --> busy: claims another job [capacity left]
  }
  online --> offline: no heartbeat for 90 s
  offline --> online: heartbeat received
  online --> disabled: admin disables
  offline --> disabled: admin disables
  disabled --> online: admin enables
  disabled --> [*]: admin deletes
  offline --> [*]: admin deletes
